  deviates capability-skills-complete: src/deep_research/__init__.py:112-127 and src/deep_research/cli.py:111-222 — The tool exposes the manifest, skill, config, research, and common navigation capabilities, and each rendered `<capability> --help` did produce a document.
  not-applicable agent-skill-is-thin: skills/deep-research/SKILL.md:absent — The tool ships no Agent Skill file under `skills/`, so there is no shipped skill to assess for thinness.
